Qwen3.8-27B on a single RTX 5090

Copyright (c) 2026 Murai Labs

This repository contains measurement data, reproducibility scripts and deployment
configuration for serving Qwen3.8-27B (NVFP4) on a single NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090
(Blackwell, sm_120) under vLLM in WSL2.

It is a third-party contribution. It is NOT an official Qwen, Alibaba, Unsloth,
vLLM or NVIDIA release, and no endorsement by any of them is implied.

Model weights and tokenizer are NOT included in this repository. Qwen3.8-27B is
distributed by its authors under Apache-2.0; the NVFP4 quantization used here is
published by Unsloth at unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-NVFP4.

The benchmark harness bench/bench_fixed.py is reused unmodified from
https://github.com/Murai-Labs/dgx-spark-x-2-upstream (MIT, same authors).

Comparative benchmark data for NVIDIA DGX Spark under
bench/results/reference/ is reproduced from Spark Arena
(https://spark-arena.com), a community leaderboard maintained by Drew
Botwinick, Eugene Rakhmatulin (eugr) and Raphael Amorim, and built on their
spark-vllm-docker, llama-benchy and sparkrun projects. The individual
Qwen3.8-27B submissions cited are by Drew Botwinick (FP8, 4 nodes) and Saiyam
Pathak (NVFP4, single node). That data is theirs, not ours; it is included for
cross-hardware comparison with attribution.
